10.	Q: What does the final output of printMST() show?
A: It shows the edges included in the MST along with their respective weights.
11.	Q: Why does the loop in printMST() start from 1?
A: Because the root node (vertex 0) has no parent, so it is excluded from the printed MST edge list.
