ALGORITHM
•	Start with any vertex (usually vertex 0).
•	Maintain a key[] array to track the minimum edge weight to reach each vertex.
•	Use mstSet[] to track which vertices are already included in the MST.
•	In each step:
•	Pick the vertex u not in mstSet with the smallest key[u].
•	Include u in the MST.
•	Update the key[] and parent[] of its adjacent vertices.
•	Repeat until all vertices are included.

